							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dealer", "profile", "complete"]
						},
						"description": "**UPDATED**: Complete dealer profile. \n\n**Changes:**\n- `machines_available` is now **OPTIONAL** - you can complete profile without machines\n- Machines are excluded from profile completion percentage calculation\n\n**Required Fields:**\n- materials (array with material details)\n- capacity_daily, capacity_monthly, capacity_unit\n- has_warehouse (boolean)\n- locations (required if has_warehouse is true)\n\n**Optional Fields:**\n- machines_available (array of machine IDs) - NOW OPTIONAL\n- bulk_orders_note (string)\n\n**Material Structure:**\nEach material object should include:\n- material_id (required)\n- brand_id (optional)\n- agent_type (required if brand_id provided: 'AUTHORIZED_AGENT' or 'DEALER')\n- finish_ids (optional array)\n- thickness_ranges (required array with unit, min, max)"
					},
